{"slug":"Leetcode-283-Move-Zeroes","title":"Leetcode#283. Move Zeroes","date":"2023-10-19","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","easy","施工中","Array","Two Pointers"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"Given an integer array , move all 's to the end of it while maintaining the relative order of the non-zero elements. Note that you must do this in-place without making a copy of the array. Example 1: ","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>Given an integer array <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>nums</span></span></code></span>, move all <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>0</span></span></code></span>'s to the end of it while maintaining the relative order of the non-zero elements.</p>\n<p><strong>Note</strong> that you must do this in-place without making a copy of the array.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [0,1,0,3,12]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: [1,3,12,0,0]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [0]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: [0]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= nums.length &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>2^31 &#x3C;= nums[i] &#x3C;= 2^31 - 1</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Follow up:</strong></p>\n<p>Could you minimize the total number of operations done?</p>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> moveZeroes</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">None</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">        Do not return anything, modify nums in-place instead.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        s </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(nums) ):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                nums[s] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> nums[i]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                s </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(s , </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(nums)):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            nums[j] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}